  "research_id": "currency-watch",
  "title": "G20 Currency Watch",
  "question": "What legal and operating system stands behind each G20 currency when IMF state, exchange regime, market function and trade pressure remain separate?",
  "bluf": "Currency Watch assesses the monetary system behind each unit through six separate performance lanes, with categorical IMF legal status and evidence freshness alongside them. It preserves the six-system July 20 pilot and three controlling extension Wave 1 cards; there is no composite or league table. The L6 repair applies prospectively. Later tariff, IMF, SDR and Japan–Korea studies explain distinct mechanisms and events without rewriting sealed measurements.",
